      "writtenOn": "2024-02-26T15:10:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since we\u0027d probably end up with two formats anyways when we add TextureViews, I wonder if we should just add another planeFormat field to DawnTextureInfo/Spec. Then we don\u0027t have to worry about passing in a TextureProxy here.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 234,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 235,
        "endChar": 91
      },
      "revId": "c0aa7b3e0b11fdfb9e9bfde74ae1737d55b6996a",
